--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY SUMMARY (web TelemetryGrid.tsx -> native TelemetryGrid)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Data: the web component is presentational over a single `VehicleState` prop supplied by its parent.
    Native binds the same data through the shared P1/S8 source seam `TelemetryGridSource` (production
    over the per-vehicle vehicle-state query + SSE live store; previews/tests inject
    InMemoryTelemetryGridSource). The view performs ZERO I/O. Data sources `useTranslation` (P1/S10
    facade `TelemetryGridStrings`) + `useUnits` (P1/S9 SI converters ported verbatim into TGUnits).
- Six tiles reproduced VERBATIM (id / icon / label / value / tone / sub):
    1 Battery   "battery.100"        common.battery   "{fmtInt(level)}%"        emerald>50 / amber>20 / rose
                  sub "{formatDistance(rated_range)} {common.range}"
    2 Speed     "speedometer"        common.speed     formatSpeed(speed)        sub Driving/Parked (>0)
    3 Inside    "thermometer.medium" common.inside    formatTemperature(inside) sub "{common.outside}: {fmtTemp(outside)}"
    4 Odometer  "location.north.fill" common.odometer formatDistance(odo,{precision:0})
    5 Charger   "battery.100.bolt"   common.charger   is_charging?"{fmtInt(power)} kW":NotCharging  emerald/muted
                  sub is_charging && ttf!=nil ? "Full in {fmtNumber(ttf)}h"
    6 Sentry    "eye.fill"           common.sentry    sentry_mode?Active:Off    rose/muted
- Tone map (web InfoTile color -> P1/S9 tokens): primary->textPrimary, success->statusSuccess (emerald-300),
    warning->statusWarning (amber-300), danger->statusDanger (rose-300), muted->textMuted (--text-muted).
- Shared components mapped: @/components/motion StaggerContainer/StaggerItem -> TSStaggerContainer /
    TSStaggerItem (per-tile index cascade); GlassPanel -> TSGlassPanel; Skeleton -> TSSkeleton;
    EmptyState -> TSEmptyState; QueryError -> TSQueryError; lucide glyphs -> SF Symbols (above).
- i18n: EXACT parity keys from source (common.battery/range/speed/inside/outside/odometer/charger/sentry)
    plus every web-hardcoded literal promoted to a key so NO English literal lives in Swift
    (common.active/off, telemetryGrid.driving/parked/notCharging/chargerPower("%@ kW")/fullIn("Full in %@h"))
    plus the P4 leaf chrome (telemetryGrid.refresh/updating/live/stale/offline/freshness.label/
    staleBanner/offlineBanner/age.*/loading/empty.*/error.message/accessibilityLabel). Table "TelemetryGrid".
- States rendered (no hidden surface): loading (6-tile skeleton grid), empty (resolved w/ no VehicleState ->
    TSEmptyState, never blank), error (parent-query failure -> TSQueryError + retry), data (responsive
    2->6 col grid matching web grid-cols-2 sm:3 lg:4 xl:6); connection axis live/stale/offline
    (freshness chip + banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the stale transition; offline keeps last-known
    cached grid and does NOT refetch).
- Accessibility: per-tile combined spoken label ("label, value, sub"), decorative icons hidden, refresh
    control labelled, surface-level VoiceOver container label; Dynamic Type via tokens; Reduce-Motion
    respected by TSFadeIn / TSStaggerItem / TSSkeleton.
- Telemetry: view.opened emitted once on start() with surface slug "TelemetryGrid" (P1/S11).

